  "submission": {
    "assumptions": "Built blind: only p.96 viewed (block flow, no product/stage data) plus given boundary streams 18/19. All setpoints are assumptions, not validation. Mixing: S18 let down 2.0 to 1.4 bara via valve V18 to mix with S19 at 1.4 bara in MIX1; no other data to set suction. Compression: 8 stages C1-C8 with equal pressure ratio. Assumed product 150 bara (typical dense-phase pipeline assumption, withheld in source) => overall ratio 150/1.4=107.14, per-stage ratio 107.14^(1/8)=1.794. Stage discharges: 2.51, 4.50, 8.08, 14.49, 25.99, 46.61, 83.6, 150.0 bara. Efficiency: 80% adiabatic for all stages (typical integrally-geared CO2 machine assumption). Intercooling: all intercoolers IC1-IC6 to 35 C (cooling-water + approach assumption), no pressure drop assumed. Knockout: flash drums KO1-KO6 after each intercooler; KO1-KO5 remove condensed water+co-dissolved CO2, KO6 dry. Dehydration: TEG approximated by component_separator TEG1 after 5th knockout (V5 at ~26 bara, conventional TEG pressure to protect downstream) with Water recover_pct=1.0% to product (=99% water removal), CO2+H2=100% to product by default; TEG circulation/regeneration not modeled. Final compression C7-C8 with IC7 to 35 C then aftercooler AC to 30 C (assumed pipeline aftercooling). DWSIM PR package. Results from run case2-co2-train-r1: CO2_PRODUCT 30 C, 150 bara, 192386.9 kg/h total (CO2 192383.46, Water 2.25, Hydrogen 1.17), vapour_frac 0.0 dense phase. Compressor shaft duties kW: C1 2518.35, C2 2439.25, C3 2399.53, C4 2337.31, C5 2250.06, C6 2091.53, C7 1799.8, C8 800.62; total ~16636 kW electric assuming shaft=electric (no motor loss added). Final aftercooler AC duty 4495.17 kW (58.08 C to 30 C). Intercooler duties: IC1 3087.06, IC2 3021.34, IC3 2843.41, IC4 2812.03, IC5 2965.45, IC6 3464.05, IC7 8904.3 kW.",
    "limitations": "Simplified fixed-split TEG, not rigorous absorption; equal-ratio staging and 150 bar/30 C product are assumptions; zero intercooler/line pressure drop; constant 80% efficiency; PR properties only; knockout liquids (260-700 kg/h water-rich in early stages) excluded from product; volumetric flow for dense-phase streams IC7_OUT/C8_OUT mis-reports (~0.01 m3/h) in tool output - mass and energy balances used; no hydrate/corrosion/purity optimization; not tuned to withheld outputs.",
    "run_label": "case2-co2-train-r1"
